  title = 'Children''s Literature',
  goal = 'Children''s Literature',
  summary = 'Frame children''s literature as art, literacy support, cultural memory, a classroom resource, and a field shaped by publishing, schooling, libraries, and childhood studies. Topics cover reader response and reading motivation, genres, formats, and collection architecture, picture books and visual literacy, folk literature, poetry and performance, realistic and historical fiction, speculative worlds, nonfiction and inquiry, representation and global literature, awards and evaluation, intellectual freedom, teaching across the curriculum, literacy development and accessibility, and capstone collection design.',
