tions when selected and framed thoughtfully."}]}, {"id": "cbc216e7-6775-4b81-a12a-4b73e571abfb", "type": "topic", "title": "Historical Fiction, Biography, Memoir, and Informational Narrative", "description": "Helps students select and teach texts that build historical understanding while balancing evidence, empathy, and accuracy.", "children": [{"id": "f8a2699a-1442-402d-a9aa-eb1bd91641d2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Historical Fiction as Story and Evidence", "children": [{"id": "ea246d5f-37f7-4efa-b02c-7fba4ea592f3", "type": "concept", "title": "historical setting"}, {"id": "111e86c3-945b-4a7c-88f8-4fcf8a711602", "type": "concept", "title": "period detail"}, {"id": "737f6e43-8816-4044-b9be-6f34d6022f06", "type": "concept", "title": "primary source"}, {"id": "0345cab3-c11f-4c1b-a7e1-abebdc4c7337", "type": "concept", "title": "author's note"}, {"id": "8fcfc219-7095-409a-a468-5c88d814908d", "type": "concept", "title": "historical empathy"}, {"id": "8a1e81d1-beff-47b0-ae11-193d5ee80661", "type": "concept", "title": "anachronism"}, {"id": "38da4bde-9352-4772-b04d-d49629d658e4", "type": "concept", "title": "perspective"}, {"id": "9681461e-d28b-4775-b094-9f87bb6f6956", "type": "concept", "title": "silence in archives"}, {"id": "ecef3e2e-28d0-4bc7-a7f2-43e537ca87ed", "type": "concept", "title": "source list"}], "description": "Students learn to evaluate how narrative engages readers while still needing historical accuracy and context."}, {"id": "07e9e852-c49b-443c-88cd-bee261628251", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Biography and Memoir for Children", "children": [{"id": "c605dd9c-6707-4ccd-bbc0-8863d37c1e72", "type": "concept", "title": "picture book biography"}, {"id": "054052ee-a783-4bee-84f8-09fd2285db43", "type": "concept", "title": "collective biography"}, {"id": "08c0e714-e7b6-4548-a107-e4077e9ca19e", "type": "concept", "title": "memoir"}, {"id": "12214e9c-ceb0-442e-ba3b-e6cfd937ceea", "type": "concept", "title": "chronology"}, {"id": "cc2a97b1-2d96-4e1c-95a6-1e186d